# Keep the backend Docker build context small. The backend Dockerfile only
# COPYs backend/**, but Render sends the whole repo as build context — so exclude
# the frontend + all deps/build outputs.
admin-web
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.git
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/storybook-static
deliveryreport-month*
met-link-mob
observator-nep-link-ble
